Package: ubuntu-wallpapers
Version: 18.04.1-0ubuntu1+yahboom1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: JetBot Mini Image <root@localhost>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: JetBot Mini wallpaper metadata placeholder
 Satisfies the GNOME Shell dependency without installing Ubuntu's
 stock wallpaper collection. The JetBot Mini wallpaper is managed
 separately under /usr/share/backgrounds/jetbot-mini.
